<p data-cms-text="t-a1b6c8490318">Great nights shouldn't cost you the next day. Unlike hydration powders or electrolyte drinks, UNDO works where it matters most \u2014 your liver. Our proprietary DHM (Dihydromyricetin) formula supports your body as you drink, tackling the root cause of rough mornings so you wake up feeling like yourself. Toss a pouch in your pocket or bag and go UNDO is always there for the moments you need them most.</p>
