<ul><li data-cms-text="t-dae943d3a857">How long does shipping take? Orders are processed within 1\u20132 business days and typically arrive within 1\u20135 business days via standard shipping. Expedited options are available at checkout.</li><li data-cms-text="t-3f6620b30b50">Do you offer free shipping? Yes \u2014 we offer free standard shipping on all orders over $60.</li><li data-cms-text="t-05e8d62b2a7b">Where do you ship? We currently ship within the United States. International shipping is not available at this time.</li><li data-cms-text="t-ebed3159d702">Can I track my order? Absolutely. Once your order ships, you'll receive a confirmation email with a tracking number so you can follow it every step of the way.</li><li data-cms-text="t-58100da9885a">No Returns &amp; 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee. We stand behind UNDO 100%. If you're not satisfied for any reason, we offer a full 30-day money-back guarantee \u2014 no hassle, no hoops.</li></ul>
